# The CI jobs run on Linux, macOS and Windows, and `scripts/ci.sh` fails when
# `moon info` rewrites an interface in the worktree (see the `info` step).
# Check out LF everywhere so `moon fmt` / `moon info` see the same bytes they
# committed: with the default `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows, MoonBit reads a
# CRLF copy of each file, regenerates `.mbti` without the CRs, and the job fails
# on a diff nobody made.
* text=auto eol=lf
